{"parse": {"title": "末日与末日之后-03", "pageid": 101316, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E-02\" title=\"末日与末日之后-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">末日与末日之后-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E-04\" title=\"末日与末日之后-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">末日与末日之后</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9C.AB.E6.97.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"末日\">末日</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 末日</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Doomsday</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金发少女眉头紧锁，行至走廊尽头又折返，来回反复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-633301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-633301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-633301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>怎么，你还没有想好？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>怀中不请自来的小生物耐不住性子探出头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>那个蛇女只是要你试试新版的传送软盘，岂不是随便去哪里都可以？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>可是“随便去哪里”又是哪里呢？这个世界……是那样大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我很抱歉，我这样犹豫不决，耽误您的时间了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩愧疚的表情让含章鼎不自在地抓了抓自己的皮肤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>不用和我道歉，是我自己要跟上来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>传送软盘肯定会十分抢手，但拉普拉斯短时间不大可能开放对民间的销售权。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>所以我得想办法弄清楚这东西的原理。<br />既然那小气的蛇发女妖不肯分给我几张试试……我只能蹭你的了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>你去哪里，我就去哪里。也不是什么慢两分钟，世界末日就会降临的事情。<br />你慢慢想呗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他话语中的某个词语令库珀花环微怔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>世界末日……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>说起来，曾经的我很相信那些关于末日的预言。<br />大概是在五岁的时候，我们进行演出的镇上有一位占卜师婆婆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>她说终有一天，大地会裂开、洪水将肆虐，我们所爱的一切都会消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>当时的我听后害怕极了，跑回帐篷里抱着科兹洛夫先生不说话，让他担心了好一会儿——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脸上浮现出恍然的神色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我还记得那里……那是在摩尔曼斯克。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>科兹洛夫先生说过，他就是在那里捡到的我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>在我五岁那年的冬天，我们回到那座城市演出。<br />那恰好是十年前——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>1977年，就是这一年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>哦，你想去那里看看吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她迟疑了片刻，最终点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抽出第一张传送软盘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>默念目的地的名字，发动“转念即至”的仪式……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她深吸一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我的目的地是……摩尔曼斯克。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>关于那座城市的记忆涌上心头。<br />气派的港口，高大的雕塑……记忆逆流而上，直到遥远的往昔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>温暖的大衣遮蔽了风雪，帐篷撑起一方载满欢声笑语的小世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>术式被激活，手中的软盘开始剧烈地颤动，她的脑海中忽然不受控制地浮现出了另一个单词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——“家”。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_maxituan\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_maxituan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>快瞧，你的娜塔莉亚阿姨上场了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处，一个窈窕的身影出现在帐篷天幕下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众：</div><div>天呐，她就像是能飞一样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人都屏住了呼吸，惊呼声也变得小心翼翼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女子脚下的钢索仅有一指宽，稍有差池就会从十数米高的地方坠下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——但她却如履平地。<br />遥遥望去，就像是在空中漫步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，她踏上另一侧的高台，向观众席致意。<br />片刻的沉默后，掌声排山倒海般炸开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众：</div><div>太棒了！乌特恩亚亚，太棒了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铺天盖地的欢呼声中，男人笑着望向年幼的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-633101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-633101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-633101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>看到了吗？没事的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-633101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-633101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-633101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>娜塔莉亚阿姨不会从钢索上掉下来，安德烈哥哥的飞刀不会扔偏，巴勇也不会有一天突然给你叶列娜姐姐来上一口……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>咱们的帐篷每一次都钉得结结实实，任外面风再大也不会塌。<br />就算外面地震了、发洪水了，咱们也会好好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>所以笑一笑吧，阿涅娅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-633110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科兹洛夫：</div><div>别听那个老婆婆胡说，根本没有什么世界末日。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_xueshan\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_xueshan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>寒风呼啸，厚厚的积雪令步履艰难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但这并没能阻拦库珀花环的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>快到了……就在前面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我记得很清楚，当时马戏团就驻扎在那边，在那片小湖边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-633320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-633320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-633320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:77%\">喂！喂——</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她隐约听到呼唤自己的声音，但四下张望，目光所及之处均是一片雪白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633316.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-633316.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633316.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633316.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-633316.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633316.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-633316.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633316.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>在这里啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她循声低下头，一颗小脑袋从衣口钻了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>蜥蜴先生，怎么了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>很抱歉因为使用软盘时我分了心，导致我们的传送地点有些偏离了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>但请相信我，我们马上就要到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小生物愤怒地跳了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>什么蜥蜴，我是蝾螈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>咦，是这样的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我一直以为——抱歉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那颗小脑袋甩了甩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>不对，我要说的不是这个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>——你到底要去哪里？我的意思是，你明白的对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夹着冰碴的雪花扑到库珀花环的脸上，咆哮的寒风卷走了含章鼎末尾的话语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>什么？蜥——我是说蝾螈先生，您说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我没听清——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-623810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-623810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-623810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:83%\">我是说——不要再——全都——</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狂风仍在肆虐，小小的神秘学家似乎说了些什么，但库珀花环听不真切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>您先躲进我衣服里面吧——现在风有些大了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>凛冽的寒风像是刀子一样，刮得她头疼欲裂，前额和身上甚至开始奇妙地发烫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>呼……呼……这次疏忽了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这里比我想象中的还要冷，我应该备件厚外套的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她犹豫了片刻，考虑是否应当就此折返。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通常她更倾向于谨慎行事，但想到目的地近在眼前，库珀花环最终还是选择驱使僵硬的双腿向前走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这并非她一贯的作风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>快到了……就快到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>呼……呼…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风雪令视野受限，库珀花环用了比预期更多的时间寻找方向，不知不觉间手脚已失去了知觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>有了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但当所寻之物映入眼帘，她的脚步奇迹般地再次轻盈了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>就是这里！<br />翻过这个小山坡，就是马戏团驻扎的地方——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_xueshan\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_xueshan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_xueshan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……咦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>翻过那座小山坡，她呆立在了原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那里什么都没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>奇怪，这是为什——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她茫然地试图环顾四周，映入眼中的景色却在转头的同时整个旋转了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从不知什么地方传来了重物落在雪地上的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>唔……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻后，大脑才迟钝地反应过来那个“重物”就是她自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-633314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-633314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-633314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:83%\">我都说了停下！你失温了，这样下去会死的！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-633314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-633314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-633314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:83%\">传送软盘在哪里？给我，我带你回去——</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有什么东西蹿上她的胸口，向她呼喊着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……回去？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>回……哪里去？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环回忆起了方才夹在风中飘来、却被自己刻意忽略的话语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633315.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-633315.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633315.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633315.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-633315.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633315.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-633315.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633315.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>我是说，不要再往前走了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633315.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-633315.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633315.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633315.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-633315.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633315.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-633315.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633315.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>——你那个马戏团的人都被“暴雨”带走了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>哦……对了，我都忘了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>瞧我，怎么这样糊涂。明明冷周六女士他们已经告诉过我了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>他们不会在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再一次，意识逐渐远去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她知道这次不再会有人将她裹入大衣之中，为她建造一方遮挡风雪的小世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她所爱的一切都已消失，她的世界末日已经到来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但忽然，五感中仅剩的听觉捕捉到了某个动静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那像是脚步声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——不，但这怎么可能？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然而脚步声越来越近。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，一个和她心中所期盼的声音相迥异的、但确确实实存在的惊呼声传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-633520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-633520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-633520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>天哪——孩子，快振作些！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在最后一丝神智消失前，一双与记忆中同样温暖而有力的手臂将她拥入怀中。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "末日与末日之后-03"}}